918758eeb566e9899f43b1c","author":{"name":"Jacky","email":"newbdez33@gmail.com","date":"2026-03-27T13:12:20Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-08T12:02:47Z"},"tree":{"sha":"d20732b5c1322950806c1b04c5857b605a60884c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/d20732b5c1322950806c1b04c5857b605a60884c"},"message":"db: scope DestroyUser to only delete the target user's pre-auth keys\n\nDestroyUser called ListPreAuthKeys(tx) which returns ALL pre-auth keys\nacross all users, then deleted every one of them. This caused deleting\nany single user to wipe out pre-auth keys for every other user.\n\nExtract a ListPreAuthKeysByUser function (consistent with the existing\nListNodesByUser pattern) and use it in DestroyUser to scope key deletion\nto the user being destroyed.\n\nAdd unit test (table-driven in TestDestroyUserErrors) and integration\ntest to prevent regression.\n\nFixes #3154\n\nCo-authored-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@dalby.cc>","parents":[{"sha":"442fcdbd33065f56650c40d7cbd455e73cb0c64e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/442fcdbd33065f56650c40d7cbd455e73cb0c64e","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/442fcdbd33065f56650c40d7cbd455e73cb0c64e"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":24294237213,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz8871hiPizwAAAAWoDKQd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/24294237213","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gi